<title>PARAGUAY: Paraguay inflation 0.4 percent in August.</title>
<headline>Paraguay inflation 0.4 percent in August.</headline>
<dateline>ASUNCION 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paraguayan inflation was 0.4 percent in August, the same as in July but above the -0.2 percent in August 1995, the Central Bank said Monday.</p>
<p>In the first eight months of 1996, inflation was a cumulative 7.2 pct, down from the 8.1 pct measured in the same 1995 period.</p>
<p>The government had forecast 1996 inflation at 9.0 percent.</p>
<p>Twelve-month inflation to the end of August was 9.7 percent.</p>
<p>-- Jose Maria Amarilla, Asuncion Newsroom, 595 21 444527</p>
</text>
